{"t":"ASML","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"ASML Holding N.V.","ko":"ASML","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","employees":44681,"hq":"Veldhoven, Netherlands","website":"https://www.asml.com","summary_en":"ASML Holding N.V. provides lithography solutions for the development, production, marketing, sales, upgrading, and servicing of advanced semiconductor equipment systems. The company offers lithography, metrology, and inspection systems. It also provides extreme ultraviolet lithography systems; and deep ultraviolet lithography systems comprising immersion and dry lithography systems solutions to manufacture various range of semiconductor nodes and technologies. In addition, the company offers metrology and inspection systems, including YieldStar optical metrology systems, a diffraction-based wafer metrology platform to assess the quality of patterns on the wafers; and HMI electron beam solutions to locate and analyze individual chip defects. Further, it provides computational lithography solutions, and lithography systems and control software solutions; and refurbishes and upgrades lithography systems, as well as offers customer support and related services. Additionally, the company offers hardware, software, and services to chipmakers to produce the patterns of integrated circuits. It operates in Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Taiwan, China, rest of Asia, the Netherlands, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the United States. The company was formerly known as ASM Lithography Holding N.V. and changed its name to ASML Holding N.V. in 2001. ASML Holding N.V. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Veldhoven, the Netherlands.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"ASML Holding N.V.는 고급 반도체 장비 시스템의 개발, 생산, 마케팅, 판매, 업그레이드 및 서비스를 위한 리소그래피 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 리소그래피, 계측 및 검사 시스템을 제공합니다. 또한 극자외선 리소그래피 시스템도 제공합니다. 다양한 범위의 반도체 노드 및 기술을 제조하기 위한 침지 및 건식 리소그래피 시스템 솔루션으로 구성된 심자외선 리소그래피 시스템. 또한 회사는 웨이퍼의 패턴 품질을 평가하기 위한 회절 기반 웨이퍼 계측 플랫폼인 YieldStar 광학 계측 시스템을 포함한 계측 및 검사 시스템을 제공합니다. 개별 칩 결함을 찾아 분석하는 HMI 전자빔 솔루션. 또한 전산 리소그래피 솔루션, 리소그래피 시스템 및 제어 소프트웨어 솔루션을 제공합니다. 리소그래피 시스템을 개조 및 업그레이드하고 고객 지원 및 관련 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 이 회사는 집적 회로 패턴을 생산하기 위해 칩 제조업체에 하드웨어, 소프트웨어 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 일본, 한국, 싱가포르, 대만, 중국, 기타 아시아 지역, 네덜란드, 기타 유럽 지역, 중동, 아프리카 및 미국에서 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 이전에 ASM Lithography Holding N.V.로 알려졌으며 2001년에 ASML Holding N.V.로 이름을 변경했습니다. ASML Holding N.V.는 1984년에 설립되었으며 네덜란드 Veldhoven에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":1415.98,"mcap":545743798272.0,"pe":34.842026,"fpe":22.33432,"peg":0.7348,"ps":13.825574,"pb":1215.8297,"ev_ebitda":1834.573,"div":0.67,"beta":1.333,"hi52":1999.96,"lo52":946.11},"fin":{"rev":39473500160.0,"rev_g":0.552,"eps_g":1.359,"gross":0.54337,"op":0.38551998,"net":0.34135,"roe":0.65636003,"fcf":10374124544.0,"cash":12735099904.0,"debt":1963000064.0,"de":8.897,"eps":40.64,"feps":63.39929},"own":{"short":0.003,"inst":0.19894,"insider":8.9999994e-05},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":2108.2075,"median":2255.0554,"high":2789.9497,"low":849.3139,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.36585,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":7,"buy":31,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":7,"buy":31,"hold":2,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":31,"hold":3,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":32,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":2350.0,"priorPriceTarget":2400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-07-16","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":2400.0,"priorPriceTarget":2200.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-07-16","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":2500.0,"priorPriceTarget":2200.0},{"GradeDate":"20